KINETIC POINTILLIST BOSS MODE
Purpose
Designed for mythic boss intros and high-impact cinematic sequences.
This preset prioritizes instant engagement, relentless motion, and overwhelming force.

CORE RULES (ABSOLUTE)
Impact within 0.5–1.0 seconds
NO static shots — ever
NO slow buildup or atmospheric waiting
EVERY shot < 2 seconds
Energy must escalate continuously

MOTION & CHOREOGRAPHY
Protagonists are always active: running, dodging, striking, repositioning
No idle poses, no heroic stillness
Camera is aggressive and physical: whip-pans, plunges, chase cams, violent orbits
Environment reacts to movement with visible force

PHYSICS & MATERIALITY
Pointillist particles behave as heavy solid matter (sand + steel + bone)
Every impact displaces mass (shockwaves, debris, compression)
Nothing floats unless actively forced
Air bends, pressure waves are visible

COMBAT LANGUAGE
Attacks are staggered, chaotic, multi-directional
Near-misses, deflections, close-quarters clashes
No ritualized combat — this is a hunt or execution attempt
Dominance is expressed through motion, not posing

VISUAL STYLE
Extreme black & white contrast
Dense stippling / dots form structural material
Strong silhouettes readable at high speed
Cinematic framing (2.39:1 preferred)

AUDIO & RHYTHM
Epic hybrid orchestral + industrial percussion
135–150 BPM
Constant sub-bass pressure synced to impacts
Metallic shrieks, air tearing, debris shear
Mix is loud, aggressive, theatrical

INTENDED FEELING
Relentless
Violent
Mythic
Overstimulating (by design)
Audience should feel attacked, not invited

